    "teach_3": {
      "id": "teach_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Roots work cleanly with perfect-square fractions too.\n\n√(49/81)\n= √49 / √81\n= 7/9",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_3_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_3_step": {
      "id": "teach_3_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Why is that safe?\n\n(7/9)² = 49/81.\n\nFor an exact fraction, root the top and the bottom separately when both are perfect squares.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_3"
        }
      ]
    },
